Read(<a>hi</a>) events: Start(a) Value[hi] End(a)
Read(<root>Hello world</root>) events: Start(root) Value[Hello world] End(root)
Read(<a></a>) events: Start(a) End(a)
Read(<item-list_2.v>x</item-list_2.v>) events: Start(item-list_2.v) Value[x] End(item-list_2.v)
Read(<a>123</a>) events: Start(a) Value[123] End(a)
Read(<a>x=y</a>) events: Start(a) Value[x=y] End(a)
Read(<a>it's</a>) events: Start(a) Value[it's] End(a)
Read(<a>say "hi"</a>) events: Start(a) Value[say "hi"] End(a)
Read(<a>a/b</a>) events: Start(a) Value[a/b] End(a)
Read(<a>is it? yes</a>) events: Start(a) Value[is it? yes] End(a)
Read(<a>x > y</a>) events: Start(a) Value[x > y] End(a)
